v> \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-block\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-road\"></i>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"subtitle\">SRAP 2.0</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/SRAP-2.O.pdf\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Strategic Roadmap and Action Plan (2024-2027)</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"hover-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"image-layer\" style=\"background-image: url(https://nitda.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Screenshot-2024-02-12-195014.png);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/SRAP-2.O.pdf\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">SRAP 2.0</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">Strategic Roadmap and Action Plan (2024-2027)</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"more-link\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/SRAP-2.O.pdf\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\"><span\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"flaticon-right-2\"></span></a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div> \r\n\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-15b1215 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"15b1215\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-030d231\" data-id=\"030d231\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34bc9c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-citygovt_about\" data-id=\"34bc9c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"citygovt_about.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"about-section\">\r\n\t<div class=\"image-layer\" style=\"background-image: url(https://nitda.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Untitled-1.png);\"></div>\r\n\t<div class=\"pattern-layer\" style=\"background-image: url();\"></div>\r\n\t<div class=\"auto-container\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"content-box\">\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sec-title light\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><p style=\"font-family:Verdana;font-size:32px;font-weight:bold\">From The Director General's Desk</h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content_box clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"image_box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Untitled-2.png\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"amg\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\" class=\"over-link lightbox-image\"><span class=\"flaticon-play\"></span></a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text_box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"upper-text \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong><span class=\"big-letter\">N</span> ational Information Technology Development Agency (NITDA) was created in April 2001 to implement the Nigerian Information Technology Policy and co-ordinate general IT development in the country.\nOur Act (National Information Technology Development Act (2007) mandates us to create a framework for the planning, research, development, standardization, application, coordination, monitoring, evaluation, and regulation of Information Technology practices, activities and systems in Nigeria.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\"><p style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong> Our strategic priorities are centered around: Fostering digital literacy and cultivating talents; Building a robust technology research ecosystem; Strengthening policy implementation and legal framework; Promoting inclusive access to digital infrastructure and services; Strengthening cybersecurity and enhancing digital trust; Nurturing an innovative and entrepreneurial ecosystem; Forging strategic partnerships and collaboration; Cultivating a vibrant organisational culture and an agile workforce in NITDA.\nWe invite the ecosystem to join us through collaborations and partnerships in achieving these priorities and improving the digital economy.\n</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"authour_box clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/background/\" class=\"theme-btn btn-style-one left_float\"><span class=\"btn-title\">More About Us</span></a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info left_float\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"name\"><p style=\"font-family:Verdana;\"><strong>Kashifu Inuwa Abdullahi, <em>CCIE</em></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"designation\">Director General/CEO</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"signature left_float\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"quote-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"round-point\">+</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-one\"><span class=\"flaticon-left-quote\"></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-two\"><span class=\"flaticon-left-quote\"></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">My highest priority is fostering the development and effective IT regulation in Nigeria</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b2b5546 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b2b5546\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-01b8c5b\" data-id=\"01b8c5b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70cd518 elementor-widget elementor-widget-citygovt_service\" data-id=\"70cd518\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"citygovt_service.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"services-section\">\r\n\t<div class=\"auto-container\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"sec-title  with-separator centered\">\r\n\t\t\t<h2>Our Services</h2>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"separator\"><span class=\"cir c-1\"></span><span class=\"cir c-2\"></span><span class=\"cir c-3\"></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"#Our%20Services\"><span class=\"flaticon-right-2\"></span></a></div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"row clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-block-two col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon  flaticon-government\"></i>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/software-testing-lab/\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Software Testing</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">As part of its regulatory duties, the Agency sought an end to the huge financial losses experienced by both corporate</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"read-more\"><a\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/software-testing-lab/\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Read More</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-block-two col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon fas fa-city\"></i>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/?page_id=2103\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">IT Clearance</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">NITDA as the clearing House of IT Projects in Nigeria has been mandated to clear all IT Projects</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"read-more\"><a\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/?page_id=2103\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Read More</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-block-two col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon far fa-folder-open\"></i>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/certification-licensing-of-oems/\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Licensing of OEMs</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">NITDA, as the regulator of the Nigerian IT sector, is empowered by section 6 of its enabling Act</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"read-more\"><a\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/?page_id=2103\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Read More</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-block-two col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon fas fa-folder-open\"></i>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/?page_id=2119\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">IT Service Provider <br> Registration</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">NITDA is mandated by its Act to provide standards for IT and to develop local capacity in ICT </div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"read-more\"><a\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/?page_id=2119\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Read More</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-block-two col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon fas fa-globe\"></i>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/?page_id=2076\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Domain Registration</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">All websites/portal of Government constituents at all levels or specialized projects of Government</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"read-more\"><a\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/?page_id=2076\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Read More</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-block-two col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon fas fa-lock\"></i>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/vapt-service/\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">VAPT</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">The Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT) Service offered by the NITDA is a free cybersecurity service...</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"read-more\"><a\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://nitda.gov.ng/vapt-service/\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"nofollow\">Read More</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t</div>\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-abfcec7 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"abfcec7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-12d2626\