the digital economy growth.</p>\n                <p>Our mission is to foster a culture of innovation, support technological advancement, and create sustainable solutions that empower the Agency to drive digital transformation in Nigeria.  </p>\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled feature-list\">\n                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <span>Community-driven challenge selection</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <span>Expert judging and mentorship</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <span>Prizes and implementation support</span>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white shadow-sm eligibility\">\n                    <h4>Who Can Participate</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"list-unstyled feature-list mt-3\">\n                        <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                            <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                                <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <span>Interested Staff</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                            <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                                <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <span>Corp Members</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                            <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                                <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <span>Industrial Training Students</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                            <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                                <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <span>Invited External Guests </span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Timeline -->\n    <section class=\"py-5 bg-light\" id=\"timeline\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"fw-bold text-center mb-2\">Challenge Timeline</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center mb-5\">Key dates for the current innovation cycle</p>\n\n            <div class=\"timeline\">\n                                    \n                    <div class=\"timeline-item shadow-sm rounded p-4 d-flex align-items-start justify-content-between mt-3\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex\">\n                            <div class=\"timeline-marker \n                                         bg-success\n                                         \n                                        text-white me-3\">\n                                1\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n                                <h5 class=\"fw-semibold\">Challenge Submission</h5>\n                                <p class=\"mb-1 text-muted\">\n                    